the one we are going to take the advantage of.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>About</title><link>https://l1ncctf.github.io/about/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://l1ncctf.github.io/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;L1NC CTF Team members page&lt;/p&gt;
